    <tr>
     <td><para unique="1091405">88 /r</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1091407">MOV r/m8<footnote><para unique="1092377" format="TableFootnote"><anchor id="70102: TableFootnote: 1. With a REX prefix in 64-bit mode, attempts to acce"/>With a REX prefix in 64-bit mode, attempts to access AH, BH, CH, or DH will instead access SPL, DIL, BPL, or SIL, respectively.</para>
        </footnote>, r8<link unique="1092469" linkend="#70102: TableFootnote: 1. With a REX prefix in 64-bit mode, attempts to acce" xrefstyle="Footnote">1</link></para>
      </td>
